  "extractionNotes": "Declared full-time employee from 2025-10-01 at the minimum wage (4666.00, then 4806.00); pregnancy incapacity from 2026-02-03, employer sick pay 2026-02-03..2026-03-07 (33 days). ZUS opened an insurance-validity check (examination date 2026-02-03, last document 2026-04-03) and on 2026-05-11 decided she was not subject to compulsory insurance as an employee from 2025-10-01; the cover note records the sickness-benefit refusal because the title ceased under that decision. The ZUS sickness claim in the memo ends 2026-03-27; the plan block runs from the day after sick pay to that date (start inferred). Benefit-decision text not in the file, so no legal basis is recorded. Due date unknown; mode adjudication. TITLE_LIKELY_VERIFIED is expected when the non-coverage decision is stripped (new full-time job at the minimum wage, sick leave about four months after hiring)."
